00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">为深入推进基础学科人才培养，推动跨文化互动，拓宽青年学生国际交流合作渠道，强化</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">大先生</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">引领，创设青年学生接触顶尖学者机会，鼓励创新性实践，搭建拔尖学生前沿学术探索平台，切实提升人才自主培养质量，西安电子科技大学</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">将于</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">7</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">月</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">日</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">-17</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">日举</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">办</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2026“</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">成长伙伴</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">”</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">国际暑期学校（以下简称</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">“</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">国际暑期学校</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">”</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">）。现面向国内各高校计算机大类等相关专业，对计算机科学、人工智能等领域有浓厚兴趣的在校本科生招募学员。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 21pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">本期国际暑期学校，以</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">“智能前沿</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">+</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">计算创新”</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">为主题，邀请国内外大师学者，国家高层次人才，著名企业创新实践导师，通过</span><span id="_Hlk233035105"></span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">名</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">师学术讲座、名企走访参观</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">、校史</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">文博团建</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">、成长领航对话、</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">前沿精品课程、创新实践项目、等</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">方式旨在为全国计算机拔尖学生搭建学习和交流的平台，推动学生培养高质量发展。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">一、招收计划</span></p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">计划招收</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">50</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">人左右，暑期学校免收学费，统一购买保险，</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">活动期间提供免费午餐，外地学生提供免费</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">人间酒店</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">往返交通费用需自理。</span></p><table class="first-row first-col no-vband docx_ab" style="width: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><colgroup><col style="width: 63.55pt;"><col style="width: 70.9pt;"><col style="width: 111.2pt;"><col style="width: 172.3pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr class="firstRow" style="text-align: center;"><td colspan="3" style="vertical-align: middle;"><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">时</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">间</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle;"><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">内</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bol