24pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">3.</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">认同学校的办学理念与办学特色。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">三、报名方式及流程</span></p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1.</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">报名时间：即日起至</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">月</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">30</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">日</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">12</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">:00</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2.</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">报名流程：</span></p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">）申请人登录网址：</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 112, 192); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;">https://form.wjx.com/vm/txeJMBP.aspx# </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，或扫描二维码，按要求填报准确填报身份信息；</span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><img src="/__local/2/D6/F9/37C9D1254578742D9C7D93BA56F_D6C47C31_3A51.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/2D6F937C9D1254578742D9C7D93BA56F/D6C47C31/3A51" vheight=" 192pt" vwidth=" 192pt" orisrc="/__local/2/D6/F9/37C9D1254578742D9C7D93BA56F_D6C47C31_3A51.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 192pt; height: 192pt;"><br></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">）申请人上传报名表与电子文件材料至上述报名链接中。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">四、提交电子材料</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1.</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">西安电子科技大学</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2026“</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">成长伙伴</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">”</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">国际暑期学校报名表；</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2.</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">在校学习成绩单及专业排名证明；</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">3.</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">其它能体现本人科研水平及工程能力的材料（如已发表的论文、获奖证书、已获得的专利等）。</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">以上材料按顺序</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">压缩成一个</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">文件</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，文件命名为“学校</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">+</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">姓名</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">+</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">电话”</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">五、审核与入选</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">申请人入选资格由西安电子科技大学计算机科学与技术学院</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">本科教育教学办公室</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">审定，</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">7</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">月初将公布入选学员名单并邀请加入</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">“2026</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">年国际暑期学校</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">”</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">群。未入选学生不再另行通知。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">六、联系方式</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">联系人：常老师，孙老师</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">电话：</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">029-81891050</span></p></article></section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div></DIV>
   
    
